<title>USA: IBM to consolidate computer service operations-WSJ.</title>
<headline>IBM to consolidate computer service operations-WSJ.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>IBM will consolidate all its computer services operations under one brand, IBM Global Services, as part of a series of organizational changes aimed at operating the company more globally, The Wall Street Journal reported Friday.</p>
<p>The changes result from a three-year effort to end internal conflicts that set IBM organizations based in various countries against other country units, the story says.</p>
